    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the given time limit, hold down the mouse and swipe across the screen. Any fruit touched by the mouse will instantly explode, splashing colorful juice. Once enough juice has been collected, it will automatically merge and transform into a delicious pineapple, adding extra time to the countdown. Your goal is to synthesize as many pineapples as possible before time runs out and challenge your best record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! If you accidentally explode a grape, all the juice you've collected will be completely reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and easy-to-play click-based game that provides a relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various explosive fruits that create satisfying juice splashes for a highly stress-relieving effect.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the given time limit, hold down the mouse and swipe across the screen. Any fruit touched by the mouse will instantly explode, splashing colorful juice. Once enough juice has been collected, it will automatically merge and transform into a delicious pineapple, adding extra time to the countdown. Your goal is to synthesize as many pineapples as possible before time runs out and challenge your best record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! If you accidentally explode a grape, all the juice you've collected will be completely reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and easy-to-play click-based game that provides a relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various explosive fruits that create satisfying juice splashes for a highly stress-relieving effect.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Click the mouse to explode fruits and ultimately synthesize a delicious pineapple!",
